{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/11893-gadgets-facilities-infrastructure","id":11893,"title":"Gadgets, Facilities & Infrastructure","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2013-11-15T22:17:42-08:00","id":11893,"title":"Gadgets, Facilities & Infrastructure","content":"Just a few questions here.<br /> <br /> Starting off with Gadgets, they last for roughly a scene when you don't spend a Willpower Dot on them. Does the Willpower Dot have to come from the inventor, or can anyone seal the deal? I think it'd be neat if there was some way to spend a Willpower point instead for a gadget to work for say, [Primum] Days, but not sure if that'd be too much.<br /> <br /> Next, Facilities. Are Facilities inextricably linked with the God-Machine, or could Demons potentially capture a Facility/Suborn it a la Suborned Infrastructure? What benefits could that confer on a Demon, if anything?<br /> <br /> Lastly, Infrastructure. It's a very broad word for a very broad idea, I just want to check: Is it possible for Demons to create/maintain true Infrastructure a la the God-Machine?<br /> <br /> I fear I may be misunderstanding one or more of these concepts. Any clarification/assistance is appreciated.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I am no longer participating in the community. Please do not contact me about my previous work.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/159-leetsepeak","name":"Leetsepeak","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-15T22:22:08-08:00","id":11895,"title":"","content":"You're able to capture facilities and employ them to remove glitches, at least.<br /> <br /> &quot;Some Agencies maintain and safeguard at least a few restoration facilities, stolen from the God-Machine and fiercely defended. Access to such facilities is always restricted and outsiders are rarely allowed to use them without incurring a steep debt.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1134-nicias","name":"Nicias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1134_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"274"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-16T01:48:35-08:00","id":11968,"title":"","content":"Demons can maintain Infrastructure after altering it (such as the Suborned Infrastructure merit) but they can't create it from scratch.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#000000\"><b>Dave Brookshaw</b></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/14-dave-brookshaw","name":"Dave Brookshaw","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar14_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2081"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-16T20:18:40-08:00","id":12464,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dave Brookshaw</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/11893-gadgets-facilities-infrastructure?p=11968#post11968\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Demons can maintain Infrastructure after altering it (such as the Suborned Infrastructure merit) but they can't create it from scratch.</div> </div> </div> </div>I am inferring from this that Demons could control Infrastructure that isn't Suborned Infrastructure.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/214-brontes","name":"Brontes","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"31"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}